% Scenario: document information. Every string-valued entry reaches
% the Info dictionary beside the producer, which stays the writer's
% own; no dates are given, so none are written and the bytes stay
% deterministic. The integer-valued key is not an information entry
% and is left out.
[ /Title (Report) /Author (Someone) /Subject (pdfmark)
  /Keywords (bookmarks, links) /Creator (hand written) /Pages 1
  /DOCINFO pdfmark
72 700 moveto 300 700 lineto stroke
showpage
